      }
    },
    "Caddyman will validate again, create a protected backup, atomically update the target file, and reload only the Caddy process it started. If reload fails, it will restore the previous file and try to reload it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyman 会再次校验配置、创建受保护的备份并原子更新目标文件；只会重载自己启动的 Caddy 进程。重载失败时会恢复旧文件并尝试重新加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caddyman will validate the candidate again, save a protected copy of the current target, and atomically replace only that file. The imported source file will not be changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyman 会再次校验候选配置，创建受保护的当前目标备份，然后仅原子替换目标文件。不会更改导入源文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
