    "Stop Caddyman Caddy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止 Caddyman 启动的 Caddy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Caddyman's managed Caddy before applying a migration. Use the Sites tab for live site changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用迁移前请先停止 Caddyman 管理的 Caddy。服务运行时的站点更改请使用“站点”标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping Caddy…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在停止 Caddy…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Store the APP_ID,APP_TOKEN value in macOS Keychain. Caddyman injects it into its own Caddy child process only; it is never written to preferences, command arguments, logs, or a LaunchAgent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 APP_ID,APP_TOKEN 保存到 macOS 钥匙串。Caddyman 只会将其注入自己启动的 Caddy 子进程，不会写入偏好设置、命令参数、日志或 LaunchAgent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Store this DNSPod token in plain text?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要将 DNSPod Token 以明文保存吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target Caddyfile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标 Caddyfile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Keychain Read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试钥匙串读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The adapted Caddy configuration is too large to inspect safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转换后的 Caddy 配置过大，无法安全检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Caddy command did not finish before the timeout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddy 命令未能在超时时限内完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Caddyfile changed outside Caddyman. Reload it and review a fresh preview before saving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyfile 已在 Caddyman 外部更改。请重新读取并检查新的预览后再保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Caddyfile changed outside Caddyman. Reload it before editing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyfile 已在 Caddyman 外部更改。请重新读取后再编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Caddyfile contains duplicate Caddyman site IDs. No site changes were saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyfile 中存在重复的 Caddyman 站点 ID，未保存任何更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Caddyfile content changed since it was first read. This view shows the latest file contents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自首次读取后，Caddyfile 内容发生了变化。此处显示的是文件最新内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Caddyfile is not valid UTF-8 text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyfile 不是有效的 UTF-8 文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Caddyfile stores `{env.DNSPOD_TOKEN}`. Save the token in General settings; Caddyman injects it only into its child Caddy process.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyfile 中会使用 `{env.DNSPOD_TOKEN}`。请在通用设置中保存 Token；Caddyman 只会将其注入自己启动的 Caddy 子进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The check only probes the local port and does not change Caddy configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此检测仅探测本机端口，不会更改 Caddy 配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The complete diff will show a redacted token, but the chosen Caddyfile will contain the real token in plain text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整差异会遮罩 Token，但所选 Caddyfile 中会包含明文 Token。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DNSPod token must use the APP_ID,APP_TOKEN format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DNSPod Token 格式必须为 APP_ID,APP_TOKEN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The executable could not be started. Check that the selected file is a valid executable.": {
      "localizations": {
