    "Use automatic discovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用自动查找"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validate with selected Caddy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用所选 Caddy 校验"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for Caddy certificate activity. Issuance can continue in the background.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 Caddy 的证书活动信息。签发可在后台继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Caddyman opens, it starts the selected Caddyfile. Quitting Caddyman stops the Caddy process it owns.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caddyman 打开后启动所选 Caddyfile；正常退出时停止它所管理的 Caddy 进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom Caddyfile directives": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义 Caddyfile 指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sites are read from the selected Caddyfile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "站点直接从当前选中的 Caddyfile 读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit this site block using Caddyfile syntax. Other parts of the file stay untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Caddyfile 语法编辑此站点块。文件中的其他内容保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This block contains a credential. Caddyman hides it and disables raw editing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配置块包含凭证。Caddyman 会隐藏凭证并禁用原文编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes are previewed as a complete diff and validated with the selected Caddy binary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改会先显示完整差异，并使用所选 Caddy 二进制进行验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Managed region": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "托管区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caddyfile sites": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Caddyfile 站点"}}}},
    "Imported Caddyfiles": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导入的 Caddyfile"}}}},
    "Manage top-level import directives. Imported site blocks are shown read-only; nested imports are not expanded.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理顶层 import 指令。导入文件中的站点只读展示，不继续展开其中的 import。"}}}},
    "Add Import…": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"添加导入…"}}}},
    "Choose a Caddyfile in Caddy settings to manage sites.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先在 Caddy 设置中选择 Caddyfile，再管理站点。"}}}},
    "No sites in this Caddyfile": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此 Caddyfile 中没有站点"}}}},
    "Sites imported from other files appear below as read-only entries.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"从其他文件导入的站点会在下方以只读方式显示。"}}}},
    "Sites in selected Caddyfile: %d": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选 Caddyfile 中的站点：%d"}}}},
    "Edit or remove site blocks after reviewing the full diff.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看完整差异后再编辑或删除站点块。"}}}},
    "Paths resolve relative to the selected Caddyfile.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"路径以所选 Caddyfile 所在目录为基准解析。"}}}},
    "No top-level imports in the selected Caddyfile.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选 Caddyfile 没有顶层 import。"}}}},
    "Edit Path…": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"编辑路径…"}}}},
    "Delete Import…": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除导入…"}}}},
    "Read-only": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只读"}}}},
    "No site blocks found in this imported file.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此导入文件中未找到站点块。"}}}},
    "Choose and load a Caddyfile to inspect its imports.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择并加载 Caddyfile 后即可查看其导入项。"}}}},
    "Import a Caddyfile": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导入 Caddyfile"}}}},
    "Enter a file path or glob pattern. Relative paths resolve from the selected Caddyfile. Imported files are displayed read-only.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"输入文件路径或 glob 模式。相对路径以所选 Caddyfile 所在目录为基准；导入文件中的内容只读显示。"}}}},
    "Review Import…": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览导入…"}}}},
    "Sites including imports: %d": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"包含导入文件的站点数：%d"}}}},
    "No site blocks were found in the selected Caddyfile or its direct imports.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选 Caddyfile 及其直接导入文件中均未找到站点块。"}}}},
    "Enter one import path or glob pattern on a single line.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请输入单行的导入路径或 glob 模式。"}}}},
    "Imports: %d · files: %d · sites: %d": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导入项：%d · 文件：%d · 站点：%d"}}}},
    "No external files matched these imports. Named snippets remain supported by Caddy.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这些导入项没有匹配到外部文件。Caddy 命名片段仍受支持。"}}}},
    "Current Caddyfile": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前 Caddyfile"}}}},
    "No Caddyfile selected": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未选择 Caddyfile"}}}},
    "%d sites": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 个站点"}}}},
    "Select a source file to preview the sites that can be copied.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择来源文件，预览可复制的站点。"}}}},
    "Merge sites from another file": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"从其他文件合并站点"}}}},
    "Copy site blocks into the current Caddyfile after reviewing the changes.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"确认更改后，将站点配置块复制到当前 Caddyfile。"}}}},
    "Add a site here, or view sites from imported files below.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可以在这里添加站点，或在下方查看导入文件中的站点。"}}}},
    "Choose a Caddyfile to begin": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择 Caddyfile 后开始"}}}},
    "Select the active configuration in Caddy Settings.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在 Caddy 设置中选择当前配置文件。"}}}},
    "Sites in this file": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前文件中的站点"}}}},
    "Manage site blocks stored directly in the selected Caddyfile.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理直接保存在所选 Caddyfile 中的站点。"}}}},
    "No imported files yet": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"还没有导入文件"}}}},
    "Add an import to include another Caddyfile without copying its contents.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"添加 import 引用其他 Caddyfile，无需复制文件内容。"}}}},
    "Sites from imported files": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导入文件中的站点"}}}},
    "Import references are unavailable": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时无法查看导入项"}}}},
    "Manage top-level import references; imported content is read-only.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理顶层 import 引用；导入文件内容只读显示。"}}}},
    "Import reference": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导入引用"}}}},
    "Choose a file, or enter a relative path or glob pattern. Imported sites are shown read-only.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择文件，或输入相对路径、glob 模式。导入站点只读显示。"}}}},
    "Choose File…": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择文件…"}}}},
    "Relative paths are based on the selected Caddyfile’s folder.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"相对路径以所选 Caddyfile 所在文件夹为基准。"}}}},
    "Choose a Caddyfile, not a folder.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请选择 Caddyfile 文件，不要选择文件夹。"}}}},
    "A Caddyfile cannot import itself.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Caddyfile 不能导入自身。"}}}},
    "Caddyman looks for an installed Caddy binary.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Caddyman 会自动查找已安装的 Caddy。"}}}},
    "Choose the configuration Caddyman should manage.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择要由 Caddyman 管理的配置文件。"}}}},
    "Caddyman checks the selected binary for its version and DNSPod support. Site options follow the capabilities it reports.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Caddyman 会检查所选程序的版本和 DNSPod 支持情况，并据此提供站点选项。"}}}},
    "Select an existing Caddy executable you trust. Caddyman never downloads or replaces it.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请选择可信的现有 Caddy 程序。Caddyman 不会下载或替换它。"}}}},
    "Detection details": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"检测详情"}}}},
    "Site overview": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"站点概览"}}}},
    "Choose a Caddyfile in Caddy settings to view its sites.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在 Caddy 设置中选择 Caddyfile 后查看站点。"}}}},
    "Show all sites": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看全部站点"}}}},
    "Sites including imports": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"包含导入的站点"}}}},
    "The Caddyfile stores `{env.DNSPOD_TOKEN}`. Save the token in DNSPod settings; Caddyman injects it only into its child Caddy process.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Caddyfile 保存 `{env.DNSPOD_TOKEN}` 占位符。请在 DNSPod 设置中保存令牌；Caddyman 只会将其注入自己启动的 Caddy 进程。"}}}},
    "APP_ID,APP_TOKEN": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APP_ID,APP_TOKEN"}}}},
    "SHA-256": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"SHA-256"}}}},
    "caddy version · caddy list-modules --json · dns.providers.dnspod": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"caddy version · caddy list-modules --json · dns.providers.dnspod"}}}},
    "sites/*.caddy": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"sites/*.caddy"}}}}
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
